{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zsm9CC3snLjUW6S82XNcBQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:36.436158+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zsm9CC3snLjUW6S82XNcBQ","html":"<div><p><span>      <span>中国地质科学院地质力学研究所（力学所）</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>年招收推荐免试研究生工作已经启动，热忱欢迎全国优秀本科生踊跃报名！力学所由我国卓越的地质学家李四光教授亲手创立，为自然资源部中国地质调查局直属正局级事业单位，承担基础性、公益性、战略性地质调查和科学研究工作，也是国家最早确定的博士、硕士研究生培养基地和博士后工作站的单位之一。主要从事地质力学基础理论、地应力与地壳稳定性、矿产与能源地质、第四纪地质与环境、地质灾害、新构造与活动构造、极地地质等方向的研究与调查；拥有</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>个自然资源部重点实验室：活动构造与地质安全重点实验室、古地磁与古构造重建重点实验室；</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>个自然资源部野外科学观测研究站：北京地壳应力应变野外科学观测研究站、陕西宝鸡地质灾害野外科学观测研究站；</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>个自然资源部工程技术创新中心：地应力工程技术创新中心；</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>个国际组织下设机构：东亚东南亚地学计划协调委员会地应力研究中心。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>      现有</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>个一级学科博士学位授权点（地质学、地质资源与地质工程），</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>个一级学科硕士学位授权点（固体地球物理学），</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>个博士学位专业，</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>个硕士学位专业；设有地质学和地质资源与地质工程</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>个博士后科研流动站。现有</span></span><b><span><span>博士生导师</span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span>人，硕士生导师</span></span><span><span><span>57</span></span></span><span><span>人</span></span></b><span><span>。 </span></span></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>      现有“杰青”</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span>人，国家百千万人才工程</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>人，国家级青年人才</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>人，自然资源部科技领军人才</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>人，自然资源部青年人才</span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span>人，培养造就了一批高层次的地质科技人才。</span></span></span></b></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><b><span><span>学科门类</span></span></b></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><b><span><span>一级学科</span></span></b></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><b><span><span>二级学科</span></span></b></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span>理学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>地质学（</span></span></span><span><span><span>0709</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>（博士学位授权点）</span></span></b></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>矿物学、岩石学、矿床学</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>构造地质学</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地球化学</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第四纪地质学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>地球物理学（</span></span></span><span><span><span>0708</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>（硕士学位授权点）</span></span></b></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>固体地球物理学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>工学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>地质资源与地质工程（</span></span></span><span><span><span>0818</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>（博士学位授权点）</span></span></b></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地球探测与信息技术</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地质工程</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>资源与环境（</span></span></span><span><span><span>0857</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>（硕士专业学位授权点）</span></span></b></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>地质工程与地质灾害</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>生态地质与生态修复</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>能源勘查</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>资源勘查工程</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>勘查技术</span></span></span><span><span><span>（勘查地球物理、勘查地球化学、遥感技术）</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，理想信念坚定，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀；学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>品行表现优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>取得推免生资格，申请攻读学位的学科专业与本科专业相同或相近。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>二、研究生培养与条件保障</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>      力学所高度重视研究生教育培养工作，推动研究生教育培养高质量发展，发挥重点实验室及各类项目的优势，鼓励研究生更早更多参与科学研究，塑造提升面向未来的知识结构和能力水平，让基础研究和关键核心技术领域青年人才脱颖而出，为国家地质事业发展培养优秀青年科技人才。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>研究生指导实行导师负责制，充分发挥导师和科研群体集体指导研究生的作用，在读期间，可参与导师多个科研项目研究工作；硕士生成绩优异者可在第二学年或第三学年申请硕博连读。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>为提高人才培养质量，促进科学研究与对外交流，鼓励研究生参加国（境）内外联合培养或申请国家留学基金，鼓励研究生出国（境）参加国际学术会议或合作研究。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>建立多元奖助体系，提高研究生待遇水平。国家级项目较多且经费充足，可为研究生的创新性想法提供有力支撑。</span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>奖助名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>硕士</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>博士</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>学业奖学金</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>8000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p><p><span><span>-13000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>11000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p><p><span><span>-21000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>国家奖学金</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>20000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>30000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>国家助学金</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>15000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>助研津贴</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不少于</span><span><span>2000</span></span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>月，通过中期考核后增加</span><span><span>300</span></span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>月</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>不少于</span><span><span>3000</span></span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>月，通过中期考核后增加</span><span><span>300</span></span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>月</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>程裕淇</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究生</span></span></p><p><span><span>奖学金</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>优秀</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究生</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>优秀</span></span></p><p><span><span>学位论文</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>4000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6000</span></span><span><span>元</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>人·年</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>统一为研究生安排住宿及办公场所。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>食堂三餐全部自助餐。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>现代化的智慧教室、语音教室、显微镜室、图书室，自习室、健身房全天免费开放。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>三、报考事宜</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>推荐免试申请者请在中国地质科学院研究生院招生网站查阅报名通知或来电咨询。本通知未尽报考事宜，请参照《中国地质科学院</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生简章》。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>直博生报考注意事项：直博生是指从推荐免试硕士生中择优遴选、直接录取的博士研究生，直接攻读博士学位研究生的学习年限为</span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span>年，入学后即按照博士生的要求进行培养和管理。</span></span></span></p><p><span>      </span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>博士生导师和硕士生导师均可招收推荐免试研究生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>四、联系方式</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系部门：人事教育处</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联 系 人：王老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span><span>010-88815565</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>期待大家加入力学所大家庭！</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c0a13d35f4d5cb706c0ecda49f0336b048a9c5db11de554c38b818443cc7a4e9","textLength":1877,"sourceSha256":"574646dd08273acf0f449978bd9a55f773aa944fa31202e0c3916eb2da51a4b3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-339b281b5752ca60096c","title":"2026年中国地质科学院地质力学研究所招收2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:36.436158+00:00"}
